      "text": "All heads of city departments and agencies involved are hereby directed to extend their fullest cooperation to insure the success of this program. Only in this manner can the full weight of city services be joined with the efforts of voluntary community agencies to eliminate the menace of irresponsible adolescent delinquency.",
